  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien jazz manouche in the Django Reinhardt hot-club style. A lead Selmer-style acoustic guitar playing quick arpeggiated runs; two rhythm guitars chopping la pompe on every beat; a walking upright bass; a swinging violin trading fills with the guitar. Intimate, dry acoustic hot-club recording with the guitars upfront. A light, wry male baritone swinging the phrases and smiling through the jokes. 132 BPM, A minor. Wry, tender and warm. No drum kit, no electric guitar, no synthesizers, no autotune, no pop ballad chorus.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n半暝 我看網路影片\n一个外國阿姨咧教\n伊的手指 緊甲看無\n我暫停 閣倒轉去\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n一球毛線 灰色的\n欲送阮某 過年圍\n\n[Chorus]\n歪膏的頷巾 慢慢仔織\n一目 閣一目\n歪膏的頷巾 莫予伊知\n覕佇 冊櫥頂\n\n[Verse]\n織到一半 灰的用了\n店仔賣完 賰青色的\n頭家講 這色真四配\n我看 青甲若菜瓜\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n中央彼逝 無法度\n就參一逝 青色的\n\n[Chorus]\n歪膏的頷巾 慢慢仔織\n一目 閣一目\n歪膏的頷巾 中央青一逝\n我講 這是設計\n\n[Verse]\n二九暝 我提出來\n伊拆開 恬恬看\n目睭停佇 青彼逝\n我心肝 噗噗惝\n\n[Bridge]\n伊笑甲 歪腰\n講按呢 才認會出\n是你織的\n\n[Chorus]\n歪膏的頷巾 圍佇伊的頷\n一目 閣一目\n歪膏的頷巾 長短無平\n伊講 長的彼爿予你\n\n[Outro]\n兩个人 圍一條",
